        // - If migrateTo reverted, then balances of c and to did not change as a result of migrateTo call
        // - If migrateTo succeeded, then c's final balance is zero and the increase observed by 'to'
        //   equals the decrease of c (i.e., all Ether held by c was forwarded to 'to').
        assert(
